</table>
            <p class="Q1">All asphaltic concrete shall contain a minimum of 1% Portland Cement or dry hydrated lime by weight of total mixture.</p>

            <p class="HistoryNote">(Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017)</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.21.001.0710.3.2.1"><a name="13.21.001.0710.3.2.1">13-21-001-0710.3.2.1</a> MAG Spec 710.3.2.1. &ndash; Asphalt Concrete &ndash; Mix Design Requirements &ndash; Marshall Mix Design</h3>
            <p class="P0">Revise the percent of asphalt range for B-1 and three-quarter (3/4) inch asphaltic concrete from five percent (5%) to six percent (6%) to five and three-tenths percent (5.3%) to six percent (6%).</p>

            <p class="P0">Revise Table 710-3 as follows:</p>

            <p class="Q1">6. Dry Tensile Strength: psi, Min. from 100 to 65 for all mixes</p>

